      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Urgh?",
      "source_text": "Urgh?",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Yeah, you bet this is the wrong room!",
      "source_text": "Yeah, you bet this is the wrong room!",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 108,
      "number_raw": "108",
      "source_number": "108",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "We are the one and only Junktown gang. We have the run of the streets, and we rule the city at night.",
      "source_text": "We are the one and only Junktown gang. We have the run of the streets,\n and we rule the city at night.",
      "source_line_start": 14,
      "source_line_end": 15,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 109,
      "number_raw": "109",
      "source_number": "109",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh. Sorry. Bye.",
      "source_text": "Oh. Sorry. Bye.",
      "source_line_start": 16,
      "source_line_end": 16,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 110,
      "number_raw": "110",
      "source_number": "110",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You couldn't run the schoolyard, Chromo.",
      "source_text": "You couldn't run the schoolyard, Chromo.",
      "source_line_start": 17,
      "source_line_end": 17,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 111,
      "number_raw": "111",
      "source_number": "111",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I thought this city was run by Gizmo after hours.",
      "source_text": "I thought this city was run by Gizmo after hours.",
      "source_line_start": 18,
      "source_line_end": 18,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 112,
      "number_raw": "112",
      "source_number": "112",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Get out of here, you moron!",
      "source_text": "Get out of here, you moron!",
      "source_line_start": 19,
      "source_line_end": 19,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 14,
      "number": 113,
      "number_raw": "113",
      "source_number": "113",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "That slob can't even stand up by himself. We're the muscle in this town. We take what we want.",
      "source_text": "That slob can't even stand up by himself. We're the muscle in this town.\n We take what we want.",
      "source_line_start": 20,
      "source_line_end": 21,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 15,
      "number": 114,
      "number_raw": "114",
      "source_number": "114",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I see.",
      "source_text": "I see.",
      "source_line_start": 22,
      "source_line_end": 22,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 16,
      "number": 115,
      "number_raw": "115",
      "source_number": "115",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You have some sort of deal with Killian?",
      "source_text": "You have some sort of deal with Killian?",
      "source_line_start": 23,
      "source_line_end": 23,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 17,
      "number": 116,
      "number_raw": "116",
      "source_number": "116",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "What?! You'll pay for that remark!",
      "source_text": "What?! You'll pay for that remark!",
      "source_line_start": 24,
      "source_line_end": 24,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 18,
      "number": 117,
      "number_raw": "117",
      "source_number": "117",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "We don't bother Killian and he doesn't bother us as long as we keep it low-key. You get me?",
      "source_text": "We don't bother Killian and he doesn't bother us as long as we keep it\n low-key. You get me?",
      "source_line_start": 25,
      "source_line_end": 26,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 19,
      "number": 118,
      "number_raw": "118",
      "source_number": "118",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Yeah. Bye.",
      "source_text": "Yeah. Bye.",
      "source_line_start": 27,
      "source_line_end": 27,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 20,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I get it, all right. You have to hide out from him.",
      "source_text": "I get it, all right. You have to hide out from him.",
      "source_line_start": 28,
      "source_line_end": 28,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 21,
      "number": 120,
      "number_raw": "120",
      "source_number": "120",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "We don't take that from anybody, least of all Killian! Just because he thinks he's a glorified sheriff doesn't mean that he controls the Skulz!",
      "source_text": "We don't take that from anybody, least of all Killian! Just because\n he thinks he's a glorified sheriff doesn't mean that he controls the Skulz!",
      "source_line_start": 29,
      "source_line_end": 30,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 22,
      "number": 121,
      "number_raw": "121",
      "source_number": "121",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Sorry, didn't mean to get you all riled up.",
      "source_text": "Sorry, didn't mean to get you all riled up.",
      "source_line_start": 31,
      "source_line_end": 31,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 23,
      "number": 122,
      "number_raw": "122",
      "source_number": "122",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "So, he cramps your style, eh? Mine, too. In fact, I'm thinking of whacking him. You want in?",
      "source_text": "So, he cramps your style, eh? Mine, too. In fact, I'm thinking of\n whacking him. You want in?",
      "source_line_start": 32,
